ion></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170846078107783168469058.jpeg/oIVlA7wgtsj3d_odCOZBcB_0btsZ1Bby1_G2qOHxtqg\"/><figcaption>（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170846080716771328053641.jpeg/ni2LcDfvpyKTOR54JngH1v4uRNrb7eGUZ-WzmVHls5k\"/><figcaption>（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><p>泳裝完，頒發友誼小姐，由3號李澄晴奪得。</p><figure><img alt=\"恭喜李澄晴。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170849870924222464436529.jpeg/HLaqGPbpcCrgqkrCaYMcdruVdUNkQtpxiUl5rb9Jea0\"/><figcaption>恭喜李澄晴。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><p>頒獎完畢，立即要淘汰四位，分別是12號湯家琳、3號李澄晴、9號周芳姿與4號譚雅文。</p><figure><img alt=\"四位佳麗被淘汰。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170849965551915008028719.jpeg/8Y7TSwq5sfNnRorbE2mHrBp4ZTVDFEFLjL03B7q9Nwc\"/><figcaption>四位佳麗被淘汰。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><p>魔音女團出場</p><p>接著下來，魔音女團出場，帶領8位佳麗性感火辣跳舞。</p><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170853678450479104564038.jpeg/3wd_pSWa9fj9CDkPqpx0cQ1mFbVSl85IgZpDTreaQ04\"/><figcaption>（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170854617249484800584026.jpeg/2WbLb8okWLfdVUcMKovK-fi_jkRkezJnyvQEUPz0BFA\"/><figcaption>（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170854615143813120572908.jpeg/Qo-ZJuha5uHIYlO71ywoy9dyfKim8guUXJkfAmqZHwI\"/><figcaption>（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170854612971032576718269.jpeg/Ao29t7C-INF0R6VgCnpaAwtq4hGQcxuQ9dqn9sPap_Y\"/><figcaption>（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170854610861166592591637.jpeg/poLl07IKYN-EkN3L171o28RP6lnRDPLfoU8Wo5dPFqM\"/><figcaption>（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明攝）\" sr